/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017151646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 253/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2401/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 172/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5161/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.917      1 Template:AHSME_30p_box\n100.00%   11.917      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16446:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017151646 and revision id 118195. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}